# ─── Never commit: CRX signing key material ──────────────────────────────
# Losing privatekey.pem costs a week with Chrome Web Store support; leaking it
# in a public repo lets anyone sign an update the store will accept. See
# DEPLOY.md → Key handling. A pre-commit hook blocks these too, in case of
# `git add -f`.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore

# ─── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json
*.credentials

# ─── Build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
*.crx
*.zip
*.tgz

# ─── Tooling / editors / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
coverage/
*.log
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
